//   "text": "💻 Hiring: Fullstack Developer\n📍 Remote (Global) | 💼 Full-time | 🧑‍💻 React, Node.js, TypeScript | 💰 $8k-$12k USD/month | 🕐 6 hours ago - June 04, 2026\n\nThe company is looking for a Full Stack Developer who enjoys building web applications end-to-end, from user interfaces to backend systems. The role involves working on real product features, improving existing systems, and helping ship reliable and well-built applications.\n\nMost of the work will focus on full-stack development using React, Node.js, and TypeScript. At times, the developer may also work on Web3-related features such as wallet integrations or smart contract interactions. Expertise in Web3 is not required, but some familiarity or interest in it will be helpful.\n\nThe company values engineers who are comfortable working across the stack, who can think beyond just writing code, and who care about building things that actually work well in production.\n\n📩 To apply: Send your CV and anything you’ve built to DM Yulia Palamarchuk on LinkedIn: https://t.co/POZORgRYfi\n\n🔗 Original post: https://t.co/PHELy7U5FW\n\n⚠️ DYOR! I don’t verify every job. If someone asks to run files (even from GitHub) or ask for payment 🚩 likely a scam.\n❗️ I'm not hiring myself! I just sharing fresh web3/crypto/blockchain roles DAILY for all levels!\n\n💡 For Interns & juniors → https://t.co/F1GGJdA5dq\n💼 Mid/senior jobs → https://t.co/50NxWgaLl8\n\n#Web3 #Hiring #Fullstack #Developer #React #NodeJS #TypeScript #Remote #Crypto #Blockchain #Web3Jobs #TechJobs #RemoteWork #BlockchainDev #HiringNow",
